{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:683","content":{"id":683,"title":"三数之和","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"cf73fd45-6d66-49a4-80cb-232b715d7e8b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"97fc2f56-a474-4046-9bad-8fa0b8fc38c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个包含 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"n","collabId":"b527224a-dd14-47e9-9911-71b7feaaadad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个整数的数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，判断 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中是否存在三个元素 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"a","collabId":"d32e2077-a97a-40d6-8250-c6d664266282","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"b","collabId":"f8aacb9c-6b19-47ad-854c-589526cf4d60","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"b"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"c","collabId":"b44be76b-c122-437a-af22-96f6aae412c2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"c"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，使得 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"a + b + c = 0","collabId":"ffb06a81-7c3e-49cb-aedb-f9aceea10bd6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"a + b + c = 0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。请你找出所有和为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0","collabId":"0876838f-0315-43f6-ab09-f66805a431d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 且不重复的三元组。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"2ba244e8-6df4-4133-9568-0350ec8b6166","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"82e9d49b-f802-47b1-b5fe-f4071aec9b4a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"注意：答案中不可以包含重复的三元组。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4cad8741-7670-4fb3-ad88-c76cf7b68e45","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1:"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"24afe7b4-6a27-49f1-8ba4-34b5f5be7d39","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"aa66c360-da96-48bf-89be-6a966b016081","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [-1,0,1,2,-1,-4]\n输出：[[-1,-1,2],[-1,0,1]]","collabId":"d3702bcb-ffcf-4e8b-8296-318617e237be","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"db798466-5e6b-4528-9102-dc339e41a4e6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2:"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"3a98cd9e-0423-4f11-a8d9-d1f4d663acd1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9ebc623b-32d2-4422-a485-7e7d17acb638","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = []\n输出：[]","collabId":"4925e054-5219-4b8c-a354-e3c5dd5e6598","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"c0696b09-5124-49b9-a8a9-36f089a27579","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c19aa5b5-9466-4a64-83d5-e28de794c2fa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果只是单纯的三数之和，那么就是一道很简单的题，首先对数组进行排序，接着固定一个数，然后在剩下的数中查找有无两个数字与这个固定的数字加起来为 0，有则找到一对，使用双指针即可，具体可以参考两数之和。但是题目要求找到所有的不重复的三元组，这就使得题目有点不一样了。正是因为在这里耗费了大量的时间，我才决定将此题记录下来。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"64dc9b9b-ece4-431d-a369-2e96399ba1bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一开始我的想法就是先找到所有的三元组，然后去重。找到所有的三元组容易，但是去重难，一开始我想使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合进行去重。但是因为每一个三元组都是一个 List 集合，去重比较的是地址值，所以直接添加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"List"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 集合中是无法去重。因此我产生了一个大胆的想法，因为它比较的是地址值，所以我想写一个类继承 List 类，然后重写它的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"hashCode"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"equals"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法(我不知道 Set 是不是靠这两个判重的)，但是最后还是失败了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9c435fa0-20c3-4fcb-99ab-0752792a3469","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"后来我就去看题解，但是因为陷入了牛角尖，无法理解，觉得人家讲的不对，后来我就试图复现人家的代码，因为代码是根据别人的思路，但是按照自己的理解写的，所以写的不对，通过对比人家的代码，发现有一个地方写错了，这个地方正是我陷入误区的地方，所以通过纠正我就明白别人的算法，也就明白了如何去重。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4bf2bed9-7e73-44cb-8415-14d989eecb76","children":[{"type":"formatted","highlight":true,"text":"算法去重的核心就是如果当前固定的数与上一个数相同，那么就跳过这个数。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"我一开始不理解的原因有两个："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"893ac7de-e95e-40ed-8877-2f3d74e5204a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"83f97a12-2f2e-4ce0-829b-b197fa80711f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7cff44d7-2139-41af-8196-9fd9647dc841","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"没有意识到题目要求所有的三元组，而我之前的算法还是两数之和的逻辑，找到一个符合条件的三元组则结束，这就导致我没有意识到每一次都会找到所有与固定数有关的所有三元组，这就意味着下面那个数如果与它之前的数相同的话，它就没有查找的必要，否则就会重复。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7d759da5-bdf5-42cc-a59c-8e78a3625bcb","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9176b785-a6f7-49e2-9f41-716de8bc0b0f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一个原因就是我看成了如果下一个数与当前数相同，则跳过当前数，直接来到下一个数，这个算法肯定是错的，怪自己没有看清"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cf8322ab-a08f-4210-b3fd-e2934c95aedb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一个有可能重复的情况，先举个例子，给定数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[-1, 0, 0, 1, 1 ]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，首先固定数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-1"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/%E4%B8%89%E6%95%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%92%8C_32f9a500-f9f7-45af-b9ef-4edd36b25743.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/%E4%B8%89%E6%95%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%92%8C_32f9a500-f9f7-45af-b9ef-4edd36b25743.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"4dfeee2b-e2db-4aae-974f-343a1e571842","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4eb35696-56c9-4462-8471-691e5688e24a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此时我们找到了一个三元组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[-1, 0, 1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 使得三数之和为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"0","collabId":"03507e7a-bbf4-460b-907e-c5e5095d663f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是因为要找到所有的三元组，所以要继续寻找"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8aed2a8f-25b7-444a-a4f0-a24d96f64286.webp","uuid":"120e54e6-af57-43b8-b046-9eb0b5028315","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8aed2a8f-25b7-444a-a4f0-a24d96f64286.webp","width":259.166656368309,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"6e0b4967-6a76-42e8-b10e-136db8c8c098","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e8788cc2-f254-4fa1-9e0c-a36ce59f47fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这时我们发现又找到一个三元组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[-1, 0, 1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是我们发现这个三元组与之前那个三元组重复了，其重复的原因就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums[start] == nums[start + 1] || nums[end] == nums[end - 1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以我们只要遇到上述情况直接跳过当前数，例如当 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums[start] == nums[start + 1]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的时候，直接 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"start++"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"7952f227-1a60-493b-9bfe-4b1931c8c917","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9a8a8fd9-c6c9-474d-939f-c645c4c4be75","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Solution {\n    public List<List<Integer>> threeSum(int[] nums) {\n        List<List<Integer>> results = new ArrayList<>();\n        if (nums.length < 3) {\n            return results;\n        }\n\n        // 首先进行排序\n        Arrays.sort(nums);\n\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n            int target = nums[i];\n            \n            // 因为是升序，如果当前的数 > 0，说明后面的数全大于 0，不可能加起来为 0\n            if (target > 0) {\n                break;\n            }\n            // 不足三个数，break\n            if (i + 2 >= nums.length) {\n                break;\n            }\n\n            // 如果当前数与前一个数相同，防止重复，跳过\n            if (i > 0 && nums[i - 1] == nums[i]) continue;\n\n            int start = i + 1;\n            int end = nums.length - 1;\n            while (start < end) {\n                if (nums[start] + nums[end] + target == 0) {\n                    List<Integer> res = new ArrayList<>();\n                    res.add(target);\n                    res.add(nums[start]);\n                    res.add(nums[end]);\n                    results.add(res);\n\n                    // 防止重复\n                    while (start < end && nums[start] == nums[start + 1]) start++;\n                    while (start < end && nums[end] == nums[end - 1]) end--;\n\n                    start++;\n                    end--;\n\n                } else if (nums[start] + nums[end] + target < 0) {\n                    start++;\n                } else {\n                    end--;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return results;\n    }\n}","collabId":"a06fb3d0-090f-4e28-9182-741cb8d49007","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"828ba1da-e906-4877-8931-4d9ca8655b9a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"2e3525f1-4502-4a58-a6de-8c09cb5ff802","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"85c3c936-403b-484c-be26-f17943c8192e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5df0e017-b267-4ab8-b5c2-d4d29acef410","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/3sum/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"5c818f6c-4290-414a-975f-0ed85184f535","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"三数之和"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"双指针"},{"label":"三数之和","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:683","type":"doc","id":683}}],"prevPage":{"title":"两数之和","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:682","type":"doc","id":682}},"nextPage":{"title":"合并区间","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:691","type":"doc","id":691}},"createTime":1728990774582,"updateTime":1775928971620,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775928971620}}